# Build / docs output
dist/
build/
docs/_build/

# Preprocess/refinement bookkeeping: plan.npz + plan.lock (generated per-experiment, under each
# experiment's reproducibility/ subfolder), regenerated on demand, never committed.
**/reproducibility/plan.npz
**/reproducibility/plan.lock
# ...except the committed frozen checkpoints: the CI anchor fixture + the worked examples. These are
# deliberately versioned (reused release-gated) and regenerated on a __version__ bump.
!tests/fixtures/quartz_anchor/reproducibility/plan.npz
!tests/fixtures/quartz_anchor/reproducibility/plan.lock
!examples/experiments/quartz-checkpoint/reproducibility/plan.npz
!examples/experiments/quartz-checkpoint/reproducibility/plan.lock
!examples/experiments/abiraterone-checkpoint/reproducibility/plan.npz
!examples/experiments/abiraterone-checkpoint/reproducibility/plan.lock
# The verify-quartz-full stash: a from-scratch candidate checkpoint awaiting `just promote-quartz`
# (the explicit step that replaces the committed reference). Never committed itself.
.candidate/

# --plot-thickness output: generated PNGs, never committed (regenerate on demand)
thickness_optim/

# Paper reproduction reference CSVs (imported orientation data, not generated by this codebase)
examples/experiments/papers/colmey_et_al_2026_Acta_Cryst_A/**/*.csv

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
.idea/
.ssec.env

# Claude Code local tool config (permission allowlists, session state)
.claude/
